### 1. 初始化创建 Book 记录 (PENDING 状态)
# @name createBook
POST http://localhost:8000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project_id": "proj_default",
  "file_name": "乡土中国.epub",
  "file_type": "EPUB",
  "file_size": 1048576,
  "storage_path": "/Users/qiao.liu/Documents/ai_go/i-have-a-plan/data/projects/proj_default/books/乡土中国.epub"
}

### 2. 触发解析电子书文件
# @name parseBook
POST http://localhost:8000/api/books/parse-file
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

book_id=bk_098617a8

### 3. 获取书籍描述元数据
# @name getBookMetadata
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books/bk_098617a8
Accept: application/json

### 4. 获取书籍目录大纲树 (TOC)
# @name getBookToc
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books/bk_098617a8/toc
Accept: application/json

### 5. 获取指定章节切片内容 (分页懒加载)
# @name getChapterContent
GET http://localhost:8000/api/books/bk_098617a8/chapters/chap_01?offset=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### 6. 触发图书文件完整性验证与自愈检查
# @name verifyAndHealBook
POST http://localhost:8000/api/books/bk_098617a8/verify
Accept: application/json
